      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100000001112.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> １． </span></p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai16_bk_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"6109186\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span> <ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ジョギングを して、シャワーを <ruby>浴<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びて、<ruby>会社<rp>(</rp><rt>かいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Buổi sáng tôi chạy bộ, tắm, rồi đến công ty.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> 2 ．</span> </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai16_bk_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"6109187\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\" style=\"background-image: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\"><span> </span><span>コンサートが <ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わってから、レストランで <ruby>食事<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none; top: 286px; left: 356px;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Sau khi buổi hòa nhạc kết thúc, tôi đi ăn ở nhà hàng.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 ．</span> </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai16_bk_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"6109188\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a